p2:washedMassDatum a obo:IAO_0000109 ; rdfs:label "Data. synthetic washed-flake mass"@en ; obo:IAO_0000136 p2:washedHDPEFlakeBatch ; dcterms:source p2:batchWeighingRecord ; obo:OBI_0001938 p2:washedMassValue .
